# solar-server runtime settings — sourced by deploy/run.sh (also valid under
# systemd). App-level keys are read by pydantic-settings (xlsx_core.Settings,
# prefix XLSX_).
#
# The server is v2-only: no dag, no workbook, no recalc engine is read on any
# endpoint. The golden check is a dev-loop tool (solar-cli verify, package
# tests) and needs none of these keys.
#
# An empty env file is valid: the UI calls exactly three endpoints —
# GET /api/schema, POST /api/domains/compute {version:"v2", inputs?},
# GET /api/download/domains.xlsx?version=v2 — all pure v2-engine compute with
# zero file I/O (ModelInputs built from defaults when XLSX_INPUTS_TOML unset).

# --- service listener:
# SOLAR_HOST=127.0.0.1        # 0.0.0.0 = expose uvicorn directly, no proxy
# SOLAR_PORT=14905            # internal port; the public port is the proxy's
# SOLAR_URL_PREFIX=/solar-server   # app serves under this path prefix

# --- optional base ModelInputs TOML for v2 endpoints (defaults otherwise):
# XLSX_INPUTS_TOML=/home/appuser/solar-price-servec/inputs.toml
